            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#f3f6f9"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"tutorm5 article1\" group=\"Article\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-end\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">FEATURES</h4>\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">Crafting Robust Patent Applications</h3>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-10\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">The foundation of foiling infringement lies in drafting a strong, airtight patent application. A well-prepared application defines the invention in precise terms, covering technical details, design elements, and functional aspects that competitors might attempt to replicate. The stronger the patent, the harder it is for others to infringe without legal consequences.<br>\n<br>A patent lawyer brings technical expertise and legal acumen together. This dual perspective allows for crafting claims that are broad enough to cover variations of the invention while remaining specific enough to withstand scrutiny during the patent examination process. At Project Patent, our patent attorneys take a meticulous approach, ensuring each application undergoes a rigorous review to maximize protection.<br>\n<br>By considering potential infringement scenarios during the drafting stage, inventors can anticipate challenges and strengthen their intellectual property before it is even at risk. This proactive approach saves time, resources, and potential legal disputes down the road.&nbsp;<br></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
