          "_name": "article04",
          "_sourceTheme": "patientm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article04 patientm5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Container BG\" value=\"#ffffc0\" name=\"cardBg\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#3A001D\" name=\"border\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/patientm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/patientm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-10\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"logo-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showLogo\">\n                            <img class=\"little-radius\" src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/patientm5/components/_images/logo.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                            <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn, .logo-wrapper, .title-wrapper\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Educating Inventors on Intellectual Property</h2>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .text-wrapper\">One of the most powerful tools against patent infringement is knowledge. Understanding the scope of your rights, how to enforce them, and the strategies available empowers inventors to act decisively. Our patent attorneys don’t just handle filings; they educate clients on <a href=\"https://projectpatent.com/practice/patents\" class=\"text-success\"><b><u>how to patent an idea</u></b></a>, the differences between patents, trademarks, and copyrights, and the nuances of intellectual property enforcement.<br>\n<br>At Project Patent, we provide accessible resources, from guides to webinars, helping inventors understand complex concepts without legal jargon. By demystifying the process, we enable clients to make informed decisions and proactively protect their innovations. Knowledge is not just power; in the world of intellectual property, it’s a shield.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Read More\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "v4wX6n9tfB",
          "_anchor": "article04-1x",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "article1",
          "_sourceTheme": "talkm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"talkm5 article1\" group=\"Article\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"9\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md align\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .align\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<b>ABOUT US</b>\n\t\t\t\t</h5><br>\n\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .align\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">Leveraging Strategic Partnerships</h6>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 my col-lg-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0 pt-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Protecting intellectual property extends beyond legal filings. Strategic partnerships with patent attorneys, industry experts, and technology consultants amplify your defense against infringement. Collaborating with professionals who understand both the technical and legal aspects of innovation ensures that your strategies are comprehensive and adaptive.<br>\n<br>Project Patent by Kaufhold and Dix Patent Law excels in building such collaborative frameworks. Our team works closely with clients, providing guidance tailored to the nature of their invention, industry trends, and competitive landscape. This holistic approach helps inventors maximize the value of their intellectual property while proactively deterring potential infringers.&nbsp;<br></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".my": {
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "margin-top": "auto"
            },
            "h5, h6": {
              "background": "@primaryColor",
              "display": "inline"
            },
            "h5": {
              "position": "relative",
              "z-index": "5",
              "padding": "0 0.5rem"
            },
            "h6": {
              "line-height": "1.3 !important",
              "span": {
                "padding-right": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .align": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle, .align": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_cid": "v4wX6oN86l",
          "_anchor": "article1-1y",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
