            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#f3f6f9"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"tutorm5 article1\" group=\"Article\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-end\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">FEATURES</h4>\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">Why You Need a Patent Attorney</h3>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-10\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Many inventors underestimate the value of working with a patent attorney or patent lawyer early in the process. Filing a patent application is not just a paperwork exercise; it requires a deep understanding of both technical specifications and legal frameworks. A seasoned patent attorney can identify patentable aspects of your idea, draft precise claims, and navigate potential hurdles during the examination process.<br>\n<br>Project Patent’s attorneys are known for their clear, accessible guidance. They demystify the legal jargon, ensuring clients understand every step of the journey. With their expertise, inventors can avoid common pitfalls like incomplete documentation, vague claims, or procedural missteps that could jeopardize their protection.&nbsp;<br></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
