            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn, .title-wrapper, .logo-wrapper": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn, .logo-wrapper, .title-wrapper": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article04",
          "_sourceTheme": "patientm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article04 patientm5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Container BG\" value=\"#ffffc0\" name=\"cardBg\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#3A001D\" name=\"border\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/patientm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/patientm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-10\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"logo-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showLogo\">\n                            <img class=\"little-radius\" src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/patientm5/components/_images/logo.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                            <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn, .logo-wrapper, .title-wrapper\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Common Mistakes Inventors Make</h2>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .text-wrapper\">Many inventors make the mistake of assuming that a simple idea can be patented without proper documentation or professional guidance. Missteps such as public disclosure before filing, vague claims, or neglecting to understand <a href=\"https://projectpatent.com/practice/trademarks\" class=\"text-success\"><b><u>trademark law</u></b></a>  and copyright law can undermine your intellectual property.<br>\n<br>Project Patent emphasizes proactive planning and strategic advice. By leveraging their experience and transparent approach, clients can avoid common pitfalls and ensure that every aspect of their invention, from concept to commercialization, is legally protected.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Read More\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "v4x38ASY0w",
          "_anchor": "article04-2l",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "article1",
          "_sourceTheme": "talkm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"talkm5 article1\" group=\"Article\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"9\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md align\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .align\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<b>ABOUT US</b>\n\t\t\t\t</h5><br>\n\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .align\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">Beyond Patents: Comprehensive IP Strategy</h6>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 my col-lg-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0 pt-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Patents are just one piece of the intellectual property puzzle. Integrating them with trademark law and copyright law creates a robust framework for protecting your ideas. For instance, branding a product with a strong trademark alongside a patented invention enhances market recognition and value. Similarly, copyrighting accompanying materials, manuals, or software ensures that creative assets are protected.<br>\n<br>The full-service, transparent model offered by Project Patent ensures that inventors and businesses receive end-to-end guidance. This comprehensive strategy maximizes both the legal protection and commercial potential of your innovation, empowering inventors to confidently bring their ideas to market.&nbsp;<br></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".my": {
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "margin-top": "auto"
            },
            "h5, h6": {
              "background": "@primaryColor",
              "display": "inline"
            },
            "h5": {
              "position": "relative",
              "z-index": "5",
              "padding": "0 0.5rem"
            },
            "h6": {
              "line-height": "1.3 !important",
              "span": {
                "padding-right": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .align": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle, .align": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_cid": "v4x38BZG9k",
          "_anchor": "article1-2m",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
