                "padding": "48px",
                "background-color": "@container",
                "border": "3px solid @border",
                "box-shadow": "4px 4px 0 0 @border",
                "-webkit-flex": "inherit",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "padding": "32px 16px"
                },
                ".mbr-section-title": {
                  "margin-bottom": "32px",
                  "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                    "margin-bottom": "24px"
                  }
                },
                ".mbr-text": {
                  "margin-bottom": "0"
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ff9063",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article04",
          "_sourceTheme": "servicem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article04 servicem5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Container BG\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"container\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Container Border\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"border\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Image BG\" name=\"showImage\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Image Border Color\" value=\"#000000\" name=\"borderImage\" condition=\"showImage\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/servicem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/servicem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#f7fff7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                        <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Project Patent by Kaufhold and Dix Patent Law: Your IP Concierge</h2>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">Patents do more than protect an invention — they actively influence a company’s standing in the marketplace. When a business secures a patent, it establishes exclusive rights to produce, sell, or license a particular innovation. This exclusivity serves as a barrier to entry for competitors, effectively allowing the patent holder to dominate their niche.<br>\n<br>For industries that are heavily innovation-driven, such as technology or pharmaceuticals, patent protection can be the difference between market leadership and obscurity. Companies that strategically invest in patent services can prevent imitation, maintain product differentiation, and even command premium pricing. Project Patent by Kaufhold and Dix Patent Law equips clients with the knowledge and tools to understand these advantages, helping them align intellectual property with broader business objectives.<br>\n<br>Furthermore, the clarity provided by skilled patent attorneys ensures that inventors fully understand how their patents contribute to competitive positioning. By knowing the scope of protection and potential licensing opportunities, businesses can make informed decisions that directly impact their growth trajectory.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImage\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/1678116392-gettyimages-1429938142-2000x1333.jpg\" alt>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
