              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"tutorm5 article1\" group=\"Article\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-end\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">FEATURES</h4>\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">Driving Innovation and R&amp;D Investment</h3>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-10\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Patent services have a profound effect on research and development (R&amp;D) strategies. Companies that actively engage with intellectual property are often more willing to invest in innovative projects, knowing that their discoveries can be legally protected. This fosters a culture of experimentation and long-term thinking, which in turn fuels industry-wide progress.<br>\n<br>Patent lawyers play a crucial role in this ecosystem by advising on what can be patented, how to protect inventions efficiently, and how intellectual property intersects with other forms of protection like trademark law and copyright law. With clear guidance, businesses can prioritize high-impact projects, avoid infringing on existing patents, and create a sustainable innovation pipeline that keeps them ahead of competitors.&nbsp;<br></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "v4x4NEb07Z",
