          "_name": "article01",
          "_sourceTheme": "solvem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article01 solvem5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Label\" name=\"showLabel\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color 1\" value=\"#2ba7ff\" name=\"labelGradient_1\" condition=\"showLabel\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color 2\" value=\"#ca45ff\" name=\"labelGradient_2\" condition=\"showLabel\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color 3\" value=\"#fe881b\" name=\"labelGradient_3\" condition=\"showLabel\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Gradient\" name=\"showGradient\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Gradient 1\" value=\"#ffffc0\" name=\"gradient_1\" condition=\"showGradient\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Gradient 2\" value=\"#ffffc0\" name=\"gradient_2\" condition=\"showGradient\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Container BG\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"containerBg\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/solvem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffc0\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/solvem5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-10\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                    <div class=\"gradient-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showGradient\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"content-wrapper card\">\n                        <div class=\"label-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showLabel\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-label mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-label, .label-wrapper\">\n                                Always Reliable\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Enhancing Brand Credibility and Trust</h2>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">Beyond technical innovation, patents contribute to brand credibility. Consumers and partners often perceive companies with secured intellectual property as more trustworthy and authoritative in their field. This perception can influence purchasing decisions, investment opportunities, and strategic partnerships.<br>\n<br>A comprehensive patent service, like the one offered by Project Patent by Kaufhold and Dix Patent Law, ensures that businesses not only file and maintain patents but also communicate their <a href=\"https://projectpatent.com/why-us\" class=\"text-success\"><b><u>intellectual property</u></b></a> achievements effectively. From drafting compelling patent applications to advising on enforcement, the firm’s services help businesses convert legal protection into tangible market value.<br>\n<br>By integrating patents with broader intellectual property strategies, including trademarks and copyrights, companies can create a cohesive brand identity that resonates across markets while deterring competitors from copying their innovations.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                            <a href class=\"btn item-btn btn-primary\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                View database\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper card\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/elements-of-a-patent-search-600x400.png\" alt>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
