          "_name": "article04",
          "_sourceTheme": "patientm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article04 patientm5\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Container BG\" value=\"#ffffc0\" name=\"cardBg\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#3A001D\" name=\"border\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/patientm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/patientm5/components/_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-10\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"logo-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showLogo\">\n                            <img class=\"little-radius\" src=\"@ADDONS_PATH@/patientm5/components/_images/logo.png\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"title-wrapper\">\n                            <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn, .logo-wrapper, .title-wrapper\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">Legal Safeguards and Risk Management</h2>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .text-wrapper\">One of the most critical impacts of patent services on industry competition is risk management. Patent attorneys guide clients through potential legal challenges, helping them avoid infringement disputes while proactively defending their intellectual property.<br>\n<br>By understanding how to patent an idea and navigating the patent application process with expert support, businesses minimize exposure to costly litigation. This <a href=\"https://projectpatent.com/faq\" class=\"text-success\"><b><u>legal security</u></b></a> allows companies to focus resources on growth and innovation rather than defensive measures.<br>\n<br>Moreover, an integrated approach to intellectual property — combining patent, trademark, and copyright protection — creates a resilient framework that competitors find difficult to challenge. Firms that prioritize legal safeguards are better positioned to maintain their market edge and capitalize on emerging opportunities.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Read More\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "v4x4NHIGJH",
          "_anchor": "article04-2x",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "article1",
          "_sourceTheme": "talkm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"talkm5 article1\" group=\"Article\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"9\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 col-md align\">\n\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .align\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<b>ABOUT US</b>\n\t\t\t\t</h5><br>\n\t\t\t\t<h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle, .align\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">Fostering Collaborative and Strategic Growth</h6>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12 my col-lg-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0 pt-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Finally, patent services facilitate strategic growth by enabling collaboration and licensing opportunities. Patents can serve as a currency for partnerships, allowing companies to enter new markets or co-develop products without fear of losing control over their innovations.<br>\n<br>Expert guidance from a patent lawyer ensures that licensing agreements and partnerships are structured effectively, balancing protection with opportunity. Businesses that embrace this collaborative approach can scale faster, innovate more boldly, and maintain an adaptive competitive advantage in dynamic industries.<br>\n<br>Through comprehensive patent services, companies gain not just legal protection but a strategic roadmap for leveraging intellectual property to shape industry competition. With a trusted partner like Project Patent by Kaufhold and Dix Patent Law, inventors and businesses can confidently navigate the intersection of law, innovation, and market strategy.&nbsp;<br></p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".my": {
              "margin-bottom": "0",
              "margin-top": "auto"
            },
            "h5, h6": {
              "background": "@primaryColor",
              "display": "inline"
            },
            "h5": {
              "position": "relative",
              "z-index": "5",
              "padding": "0 0.5rem"
            },
            "h6": {
              "line-height": "1.3 !important",
              "span": {
                "padding-right": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .align": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle, .align": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
